{"v":4,"catch":"命令已下達，行動開始！\n突破敵人包圍，摧毀敵人要塞！","desc":"《D-DAY》是JALECO於1984年發行的射擊遊戲。\n你的任務是駕駛你的戰艦，擊退敵方戰艦和轟炸機，並摧毀敵方要塞。\n今天就是行動開始的日子。漫長的一天開始了…\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2025-08-07","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/408244698a2ea38e954eb8eeba244f170d8748111198db0539ea5b0cc7082677.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b9b89b2ed30ebac3fc84d67293d3254d31e7e2348fd0cc888c2595f4d3830ee6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a031e0d89072b3c4bd29f4eeaa535f99345907ee566c7076506e4e7e880b068e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/379272268ee4e4dcfb953a7ea0f81d9ab4e84b8f0cbc8d1c2c59a837d7b00392.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b50f0831f30186db6477a7fbe69335adbd4fb25890d69546cf8e3ac4d3f028f9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/be7c5cc575109459cbf447fd92c752dd9ce0e8222948b4f16e77b204e3106192.jpg"],"titleId":"01000dd0228de000","dlc":[]}